\subsubsection{Effectiveness Evaluation}
To validate AVA’s enhancement of information effectiveness, we evaluate the accuracy as shown in Figs. \ref{fig:acc-deterministic} and \ref{fig:acc-uniform}. Overall, AVA sustains strong accuracy even at very low update rates, thereby reducing energy consumption and confirming the efficiency of our approach.

