    \caption{Identity plots between the normalized velocity deficit from CFD $(Y)$ on the x-axis and the results predicted $(\widetilde{Y})$ on the y-axis by SR in (a) and (b), and the Bastankhah wake model in (c) and (d). Data points are colored based on their streamwise positions in (a) and (c), and spanwise positions in (b) and (d), respectively. The black dashed line denotes perfect match.}
