One of the key components of M3G is the Multi-Granular VQ-VAE (MGVQ-VAE) model, which encodes the motion patterns with different granularities into a shared discrete latent space as a series of motion tokens and reconstructs the motion sequence from these motion tokens.
%breaks the limitation of all token series sharing the same granularity. 
